   "text": "UkiyoFactory: anyone launches a hash-checked vault + permanent bond\nUkiyoSkillRouter: one deposit split across curators by t-statistic",
   "originalText": "UkiyoFactory: anyone launches a hash-checked vault + permanent bond\nUkiyoSkillRouter: one deposit split across curators by t-statistic",
